notes.body:
I accept the underlying functionality as great, but don't like the new dialog. We should think hard about changing the position for this.

Why is this not an option for TCP itself, we really should not create a singular dialog for setting a single option.

@AndersBroman fyi

@rknall  @johnthacker 
Can we consider this work for 4.0 ?
I don't see any alternative to a new menu, as the Protocol Preferences is too wide and doesn't target a particular packet or conversation. Another similar requirement, maybe, is that one requested in #13229 , but still not fitting well the Protocol Preferences dialog as said by the requester.

